UID:door-20-advent-2026@cyber-advent-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T162541Z
DTSTART:20261220T073000Z
DTEND:20261220T073500Z
SUMMARY:Door 20: A safe word for the family
DESCRIPTION:DO: Agree a family safe word for emergency calls and messages.\
 nDON’T: Send money on an urgent call from a “relative” or VIP — ha
 ng up and call back on a known number.\n\nLesson learnt (A cloned minister
 \, Feb 2025): Scammers cloned the voice of Defence Minister Guido Crosetto
  to ask business leaders for money. At least one paid about €1 million b
 efore police froze the funds.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.gi
 thub.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=20&mode=advent
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=20&mode=advent
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Door 20 is open
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:door-21-advent-2026@cyber-advent-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T162541Z
DTSTART:20261221T073000Z
DTEND:20261221T073500Z
SUMMARY:Door 21: Label the synthetic
DESCRIPTION:DO: Label AI-generated or manipulated images\, audio and video\
 , and keep a named human sign-off.\nDON’T: Publish synthetic media of re
 al people without consent — or let fakes of your leaders go unanswered.\
 n\nLesson learnt (WPP\, May 2024): Fraudsters used a voice clone and YouTu
 be footage of WPP’s CEO in a fake video meeting to try to set up a new b
 usiness. Alert staff stopped it.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design
 .github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=21&mode=advent
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=21&mode=advent
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Door 21 is open
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:door-22-advent-2026@cyber-advent-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T162541Z
DTSTART:20261222T073000Z
DTEND:20261222T073500Z
SUMMARY:Door 22: Know what you ship
DESCRIPTION:DO: Pin dependencies and CI actions to full commit SHAs\, keep 
 an SBOM\, and verify signatures.\nDON’T: Install a package an AI assista
 nt suggests without checking it’s real — or load untrusted model files
 .\n\nLesson learnt (tj-actions/changed-files\, Mar 2025): Attackers re-poi
 nted the version tags of a popular GitHub Action to malicious code that du
 mped CI secrets into build logs (CVE-2025-30066).\n\nOpen the door: https:
 //aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=22&mode=advent
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=22&mode=advent
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Door 22 is open
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:door-23-advent-2026@cyber-advent-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T162541Z
DTSTART:20261223T073000Z
DTEND:20261223T073500Z
SUMMARY:Door 23: Read the AI small print
DESCRIPTION:DO: Ask every vendor: is our data used for training\, where is 
 it stored\, and who are the sub-processors?\nDON’T: Approve tools on cli
 ck-through terms without a security and privacy review.\n\nLesson learnt (
 MOVEit\, May 2023): A zero-day in a widely used file-transfer product let 
 the Cl0p gang steal data from thousands of organisations — many hit thro
 ugh their suppliers.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/C
 yberAIAdvent2026/?day=23&mode=advent
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=23&mode=advent
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Door 23 is open
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:door-24-advent-2026@cyber-advent-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T162541Z
DTSTART:20261224T073000Z
DTEND:20261224T073500Z
SUMMARY:Door 24: Ready when the office is empty
DESCRIPTION:DO: Staff an on-call rota\, route alerts to a human\, and keep 
 the incident plan and contacts offline.\nDON’T: Trust backups you’ve n
 ever restored — follow 3-2-1 and test a restore before the break.\n\nLes
 son learnt (British Library\, Oct 2023): Rhysida ransomware crippled servi
 ces for months. The library’s own lessons-learned report pointed to remo
 te access without MFA and legacy systems.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-
 by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=24&mode=advent
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=24&mode=advent
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
